  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "とある　しょもつに　とうじょうするハバタクカミという　せいぶつとにた　とくちょうを　もつ　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어떤 서적에 등장하는 “날개치는머리”라는 생물과 비슷한 특징을 가진 포켓몬.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與某本書裡記載的一種叫做振翼髮的生物有著相似特徵的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon a des caractéristiques semblables à celles d’une créature évoquée dans un certain livre sous le nom de « Flotte-Mèche ».",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Einige seiner Merkmale erinnern an eine Kreatur namens Flatterhaar, die in einer gewissen Schrift erwähnt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus rasgos distintivos encajan con la descripción de una criatura mencionada en cierto libro bajo el nombre de Melenaleteo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue caratteristiche sono molto simili a quelle di Crinealato, una creatura di cui si parla in un certo documento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon has characteristics similar to those of Flutter Mane, a creature mentioned in a certain book.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とある　書物に　登場するハバタクカミという　生物と似た　特徴を　持つ　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "这只宝可梦与某本书中出现的一种叫振翼发的生物有着相似的特征。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus rasgos distintivos encajan con la descripción de una criatura mencionada en cierto libro bajo el nombre de Melenaleteo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルトざっしで　とりあげられたよくりゅうの　ゆうれいととくちょうだけは　にているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오컬트 잡지에서 소개했던 익룡의 유령과 몇몇 특징이 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只有特徵長得像是超自然雜誌所報導的翼龍的幽靈。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il présente des similitudes avec un fantôme de ptérosaure évoqué dans une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es weist gemeinsame Merkmale mit dem Geist eines Flugsauriers auf, über den in einer esoterischen Zeitschrift berichtet wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus rasgos distintivos se asemejan a los del espíritu de un reptil volador mencionado en una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue caratteristiche principali ricordano quelle di uno pterosauro fantasma menzionato in una rivista di paranormale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has similar features to a ghostly pterosaur that was covered in a paranormal magazine, but the two have little else in common.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルト雑誌で　取り上げられた翼竜の　幽霊と特徴だけは　似ているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它只有特征的部分与超自然杂志曾报道的翼龙的幽灵相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
